<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Scientific lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Scientific lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said analyst Raul Esquivel downgraded Boston Scientific Corp to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- said stock had risen 50 percent in the past three months, trading at the lower end of his 12-month price target of $70-$75.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 6-7/16 to 69-11/16.</p>
</text>
